STED INCOME FROM OPERATIONS2 FOR THE FIRST QUARTER WAS $1.7 BILLION, OR $4.73 PER SHARE ADJUSTED INCOME FROM OPERATIONS2,3 IS NOW PROJECTED TO BE AT LEAST $7.0 BILLION IN 2021, OR AT LEAST $20.20 PER SHARE3 GLOBAL HEALTH SERVICES COMPANY CIGNA CORPORATION (NYSE: CI) TODAY REPORTED STRONG FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS DRIVEN BY FOCUSED EXECUTION ACROSS ITS BUSINESSES."}{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2021-05-08 16:02:00-04:56', 'title': 'CSX Corporation Declares Quarterly Dividend', 'text': "JACKSONVILLE, FLA., MAY 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TODAY, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CSX CORP. (NASDAQ: CSX) APPROVED A $0.28 PER SHARE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 31, 2021."}{'symbol': 'DVN', 'date': '2021-05-08 08:00:00-04:56', 'title': 'Devon Energy Announces Virtual-Only Format for 2021 Annual Meeting of Stockholders', 'text': 'OKLAHOMA CITY, MAY 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DEVON ENERGY CORP. (NYSE: DVN) TODAY ANNOUNCED A CHANGE IN THE LOCATION OF ITS 2021 ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS. IN LIGHT OF CONTINUED CONCERNS REGARDING THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC, THE ANNUAL MEETING WILL BE HELD SOLELY BY REMOTE COMMUNICATION, IN A “VIRTUAL-ONLY” FORMAT. THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED DATE AND TIME OF THE MEETING (JUNE 9, 2021, AT 8:00 A.M. CENTRAL TIME) HAVE NOT CHANGED. THE DEVON ENERGY CENTER, INCLUDING THE DEVON ENERGY CENTER AUDITORIUM WHERE THE MEETING WAS TO OCCUR, WILL REMAIN CLOSED TO THE PUBLIC THROUGH THE TIME OF THE ANNUAL MEETING.'}{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-05-08 16:19:00-04:56', 'title': 'Dover Declares Regular Quarterly Cash Dividend', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., MAY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF DOVER (NYSE: DOV) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.495 (FORTY-NINE AND ONE-HALF CENTS) PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 28, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2021-05-08 08:00:00-04:56',